  "ruleText": "He-P 1604.01 Purpose. The commissioner shall investigate cases of lead poisoning in children with elevated blood lead levels as defined in RSA 130-A:5.\n\nSource. #5920, eff 1-1-95; amd by #6096, eff 9-22-95; ss by #7181, eff 12-24-99; ss by #7495, eff 5-23-01; ss by #8039, eff 2-13-04; ss by #8932, eff 7-6-07; ss by #9986, eff 9-1-11, EXPIRED: 9-1-19\n\nNew. #13052, eff 6-11-20; ss by #14230, eff 4-2-25",
